    "turn_text": "Tell us what's... This is my pride and joy, Bill. I am with the help of Bethpage Federal Credit Union and Long Island University, the Main Street Association of Oyster Bay, County of Nassau, Town of Oyster Bay. We are putting together organizing a three-day celebration of books and literature. in Oyster Bay, June 28th, 29th, 30th. And we have marquee authors, authors that were on the bestseller list. They're coming along island and they're going to do author talks, book talks. 80% of the events are completely free on Friday the 28th and Saturday the 29th. Everything will be at Long Island University. So you can come, you can find an author that you like, you can meet the author, have a book signed, have to buy the book of course. Or you don't buy the book and you just meet the author. And then on Sunday, we're doing an all-day street fair in Oyster Bay. And so the town of Oyster Bay, Supervisor Saladino, has been kind enough to shut down the street in front of our store. We'll have authors. We'll have vendors. We'll have crafts. We'll have horses. We'll have children's readings. So I hope people will come and join us. This is going to be an amazing event for people who like to read.",
